    "body": "## Purpose\n\nRepair `LESTER_CODE_EXECUTOR_NOT_BOUND` from issue #235 by connecting one protected `issue_comment.created` caller on communication PR #111 to the existing compiled `zb-r03-lester-agent.lock.yml`.\n\n## Reuse-first boundary\n\n- reuses `scripts.zb_r03_router.admit_r03_event`;\n- persists the exact dispatch with existing `write_and_verify` before execution;\n- reuses the existing compiled LESTER agent and its draft-only safe output;\n- leaves the retired legacy router retired;\n- does not restore repository_dispatch, auto-finalize, DUNCAN auto-QC, merge, production activation, canon or LOCK mutation.\n\n## Local verification\n\n- RED: 4 new boundary tests failed with `R03_LESTER_LIVE_CALLER_MISSING`.\n- GREEN: targeted R03 suite: 27/27 passed.\n- Full gate: `python3 scripts/hq_validate.py` PASS.\n- Full unittest: 284/284 passed.\n- `python3 -m compileall -q scripts tests` PASS.\n\n## Safety\n\n`MERGE = NO`\n`PRODUCTION_ACTIVE = NO`\n`AUTO_MERGE = NO`\n\nCloses no issue. Requires independent review and a later bounded live proof after merge approval.",
